]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["跟很有名的小高拉麵一樣，目前都有無限加麵！\n他的麵條都是統一的細麵，麵條的軟硬度很適中，不會過於軟爛，或是太硬，我覺得時間拿捏的剛剛好。\n今天吃的是味噌、和黑蒜拉麵，這兩碗都是$180\n口味上偏清淡，但個人口味是覺得偏油，吃完，會覺得比較膩，兩片叉燒，給的很大片，蘆筍絲也還不錯吃，只是量比較少、糖心蛋是給半顆，還有豆芽菜、木耳、蔥、海苔片！\n叉燒肉片，好吃，而且不肥，有一些叉燒，肥油實在太多！幸花的叉燒，很合我胃口👍🏻\n中華餛飩拉麵 $180\n餛飩裡面有包一整隻小蝦仁，餛飩吃起來很新鮮，好吃！而且肉片，也很嫩口👍🏻但是，湯頭也是很油。\n調味料的部分，只有七味粉，蒜泥，辣油，我覺得愛吃辣的人，可能會覺得調味的部分有點無聊！\n下次要來嘗試別種口味！",null,[0,92]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12222328628757792999/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjAxVEU1dGNFOVhSV2gwVmxaT2JsSlZTVFJhTVZKNFVURktkMDFzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12222328628757792999/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjAxVEU1dGNFOVhSV2gwVmxaT2JsSlZTVFJhTVZKNFVURktkMDFzUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12222328628757792999/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjAxVEU1dGNFOVhSV2gwVmxaT2JsSlZTVFJhTVZKNFVURktkMDFzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12222328628757792999/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjAxVEU1dGNFOVhSV2gwVmxaT2JsSlZTVFJhTVZKNFVURktkMDFzUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12222328628757792999/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjAxVEU1dGNFOVhSV2gwVmxaT2JsSlZTVFJhTVZKNFVURktkMDFzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12222328628757792999/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjAxVEU1dGNFOVhSV2gwVmxaT2JsSlZTVFJhTVZKNFVURktkMDFzUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,7038,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT201TE5tcE9XRWh0VlZOblJVSTRaMVJ4UTFKd01sRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xa5907297c0819f8!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOm5LNmpOWEhtVVNnRUI4Z1RxQ1JwMlE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT201TE5tcE9XRWh0VlZOblJVSTRaMVJ4UTFKd01sRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityi